{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirelaine is a relaxing puzzle game where building a village is not just a matter of form, but also of intention. Each building you place transforms the landscape, adding beauty and harmony... or destroying it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Select and place buildings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928300/extras/f465a89819365c50c602e2dc8361ed4d.poster.avif?t=1755873809\" width=1500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928300/extras/f465a89819365c50c602e2dc8361ed4d.webm?t=1755873809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928300/extras/f465a89819365c50c602e2dc8361ed4d.mp4?t=1755873809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Observe the rules of adjacency </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928300/extras/e4c30e3d23024f5ecc4437da82b2d6ff.poster.avif?t=1755873809\" width=1500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928300/extras/e4c30e3d23024f5ecc4437da82b2d6ff.webm?t=1755873809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928300/extras/e4c30e3d23024f5ecc4437da82b2d6ff.mp4?t=1755873809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan carefully where to build, observing the rules of adjacency between structures. Some buildings flourish next to similar ones, while certain pairings reduce the value of your village. Choose wisely and discover hidden patterns as you shape this enchanting region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Quests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928300/extras/f6651151d3e09ca501ec5fba17444c91.avif?t=1755873809\" width=1298 height=728 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each board presents you with a new challenge: to beat a \u201cCommunity Aspiration,\u201d represented by the buildings you didn't choose. Can you build an even more valuable settlement with the pieces you have?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Tactical puzzle based on placement and optimization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Relaxing aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f Unique buildings with specific scoring rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Increasing challenge with no time pressure or loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Serene music and contemplative atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build at your own pace, contemplate the results, and become the architect of Mirelaine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928300/extras/af989efef80cfba20d9e370b79d538e7.poster.avif?t=1755873809\" width=1500 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928300/extras/af989efef80cfba20d9e370b79d538e7.webm?t=1755873809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928300/extras/af989efef80cfba20d9e370b79d538e7.mp4?t=1755873809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928300?t=17558